                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Inflation is up, and Trump has done nothing except make everything more expensive with his foolish tariffs. Families are paying more for groceries, electricity, and health care, and he still refuses to lift a finger to reopen the government or lower costs. All while spending millions on his vanity ballroom construction. Working families deserve better.\n\n@HouseDemocrats @HouseDPCC",
