                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Trump Administration has the money to keep families fed, but they will not use it. Instead, 42 million Americans face losing food assistance while Trump and Republicans refuse to negotiate to lower health care costs and reopen the government.\n\nThey\u2019d rather watch families starve than do their jobs.\n\n@HouseDemocrats",
