                "text": "Hard to believe Republicans are suddenly worried about hungry families when:\n\n\u2022 Trump is illegally withholding emergency SNAP funds\n\n\u2022 Speaker Johnson hasn\u2019t worked with Democrats in over 40 days to lower health care costs\n\n\u2022 Republicans slashed $186 billion from food aid in their Big Ugly Bill earlier this year\n\nLet\u2019s not lie to the American people. If Republicans truly cared about feeding families, they\u2019d release the money and work with Democrats to reopen the government right now.",
